@startuml System Context Diagram
!theme plain
title CAN-HMI System — System Context (C4 Level 1)

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
    RoundCorner 15
}

actor "Driver / Engineer" as user
actor "Vehicle ECU\n(Real / Simulator)" as ecu

rectangle "CAN-HMI System\n(CarPC)" as system #LightBlue {
}

rectangle "DMS/OMS Camera" as camera #LightGreen
rectangle "CAN Database\n(config/can.json)" as candb #Wheat

user -down-> system : "View real-time signals,\nedit writable parameters\n(HTTP / WebSocket)"
system -down-> user : "Signal data, alarms,\nvideo stream"

ecu -right-> system : "CAN 2.0B frames\n(500 kbps)"
system -right-> ecu : "CAN write-back\n(encoded frames)"

camera -up-> system : "Video stream\n(RTP/RTSP over Ethernet)"
candb -up-> system : "Signal definitions\n(message/signal metadata)"

note left of candb
  Static data, loaded once
  at system startup
end note

note right of system
  **Responsibilities:**
  - Read / decode CAN signals (can.json)
  - Process, filter, alarm detection
  - Store time-series data (SQLite)
  - Serve REST API + WebSocket
  - Stream DMS/OMS video
end note

@enduml
